                                <ul class="list-disc ml-4 mt-2">
                                    <li><code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">docker: "python:3.13-slim"</code> - Runs in Docker container (automatically converted to Singularity on the cluster)</li>
                                    <li><code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">cpus, requested_memory_mb_per_core, runtime_minutes, queue</code> - Resources passed to SLURM</li>
                                    <li>The Cromwell SLURM configuration automatically converts Docker images to Singularity and submits jobs with the specified resources</li>
                                </ul>
                                </p>
