                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">WDL workflows on this cluster support two approaches to containerization:</p>

                        <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded mb-4">
                            <p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-2">Option 1: Docker Images (Recommended)</p>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">Use standard Docker image references. Cromwell automatically pulls and converts them to Singularity for cluster execution.</p>
