    docker: "python:3.13-slim"
    cpus: 2
    requested_memory_mb_per_core: 1024
    runtime_minutes: 30
}</code></pre>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Advantages:</strong> Portable across platforms, matches WDL standard practices, access to Docker Hub ecosystem</p>
