                            <pre class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-sm"><code class="language-wdl">runtime {
    singularity: "/path/to/myimage.sif"
    cpus: 2
    requested_memory_mb_per_core: 1024
    runtime_minutes: 30
}</code></pre>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Advantages:</strong> Faster execution (no conversion), useful for cluster-specific optimized images, fine-grained control</p>
                        </div>
