git branch -M main
git push -u origin main

# Good practices:
# - Write meaningful commit messages
# - Create a README.md explaining your project
# - Use .gitignore for data files and outputs
# - Tag releases with meaningful versions (v1.0, v2.0, etc.)</code></pre>
